{"type":"message","id":"7b417795","parentId":"87f68bad","timestamp":"2026-05-26T10:59:21.151Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"老大问的是\"能不能干活\"，意思就是别分析了，直接动手修。那我现在就去把 Git 认证问题搞定。\n\n先看看当前 git remote 配置，确定是 HTTPS 还是 SSH。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_aff0fa2e87984d578367ef98","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw && git remote -v && echo \"---\" && git config --global --list 2>/dev/null | grep -i credential","timeout":10},"partialArgs":"{\"command\": \"cd ~/.openclaw && git remote -v && echo \\\"---\\\" && git config --global --list 2>/dev/null | grep -i credential\", \"timeout\": 10}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779793142149,"responseId":"5ce00c65e2a84c5abbee41d2cb775ce0"}}
