{"type":"message","id":"37effa30","parentId":"2d238ea5","timestamp":"2026-05-26T11:02:35.131Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"No token or env var for GitHub. I need to ask 老大 to provide a GitHub personal access token so I can configure `git-credentials` for HTTPS push. Can't do it without a token.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"问题：容器里没装 SSH client 装不了，也没有 GitHub token 的环境变量。\n\n需要你给我一个 **GitHub Personal Access Token**（或者配好的 SSH key 从宿主映射进来），我才能写凭证文件。\n\n两种走法：\n\n**A. 丢个 GitHub Token 过来**（推荐，最省事）\n```bash\n# 给我 token，我直接写：\necho \"https://blocklee:${TOKEN}@github.com\" > ~/.git-credentials\n```\n\n**B. 把宿主 ~/.ssh 挂进容器**\n容器里 `ssh` 没装，装了也没法连接宿主 SSH agent。\n\n哪个方便？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779793318324,"responseId":"157f08e36df847a086d549360dd0b2b8"}}
